    "searchCoverage": "Official NiftyImages v1 REST API is HTTPS to api.niftyimages.com/v1 with the ApiKey header. GET /Widgets is the documented widget list used by the pinned credential validator and is used as healthcheck. GET /Images, GET /Image?url=, GET /Images/AllStats, and GET /Widgets/AllStats are documented reads. A separate v2 Bearer API at dev.niftyimages.com is a different edition and is not this recipe. Operator is NiftyImages LLC in California, United States. Dated incident search on 2026-09-13 found no qualifying NiftyImages platform compromise after distinguishing nifty.com (Japanese ISP) and Nifty Gateway. Bounded coverage is not a breach-free claim.",
    "incidents": [],
